## 6. VERDICT

PASS. Round 1 failed on one root cause — no persistence in the repo — and that
cause is gone: the tree is clean, the work is committed under attributable
commits, all three gates certify a tree hash, both officinae check zero
blocking, and every behaviour the brief listed has an assertion behind it. Six
of the seven round-1 findings are resolved against the tree. The seventh
(per-behaviour redEvidence) is advisory: the studio has since filed it as
L-001 and escalated it to the patron as P-001 item 3, and the only way to
close it inside W-018 would be to backfill evidence, which the studio forbids.

Recommend W-018 to done.
